  "complete_old_target": "你从脑海里召唤出一位身穿皮甲的精神体弓箭手。当精神体弓箭手到达对应等级时可习得弓术掌握、强化命中、稳固射击、致残射击和瞄准姿态，并且可增加 %d 点力量、 %d 点敏捷和 %d 体质。\n\t\t激活此技能会使其他思维形态技能进入冷却。\n\t\t属性增益受精神强度加成。",
  "complete_new_target": "你从脑海里召唤出一位身穿皮甲的精神体弓箭手。精神体弓箭手在召唤时即掌握弓术掌握、强化命中、稳固射击、致残射击和瞄准姿态，这些技能的等级取决于召唤时你的等级，并且可增加 %d 点力量、 %d 点敏捷和 %d 体质。\n\t\t激活此技能会使其他思维形态技能进入冷却。\n\t\t属性增益受精神强度加成。",
  "entry": {
    "file": "mod-tome.lua",
    "section": "mod-tome/data/talents/psionic/thought-forms.lua",
    "source": "Forge a bowman, clad in leather armor, from your thoughts.  The bowman learns Bow Mastery, Combat Accuracy, Steady Shot, Crippling Shot, and Rapid Shot as it levels up, and has +%d Strength, +%d Dexterity, and +%d Constitution.\n\t\tActivating this talent will put all other thought-forms on cooldown.\n\t\tThe stat bonuses will improve with your Mindpower.",
    "source_tag": "tformat",
    "candidate_index": 652,
    "revision_key": "0feba988725a0e5fa095106cf9039b207f55475e20bfff170248ed1539ce6ae6"
  },
  "preimage_sha256": "07da73e5530a35097aad39c9d8e79bee400dddf2e9fa659b260384a25cb2de95",
  "postimage_sha256": "d3cae3e6a852720e12f6cdb41398bc3953b869d7c60706f393cf14baedc567a8",
